                                "sense_id": "82f4d8d8-c649-37eb-b5cb-59f8d60b6bb1",
                                "text": "Substituting something that's trivial-but-noisily-immediate for something that's virtuous — even smally virtuous, like a game we play or ponder — breeds an ugly cynicism about virtue itself."
